  "headline": "Nicardipine hydrochloride is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale sites hold 15.7 to 27.9 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D1", "D2", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show nicardipine hydrochloride is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 222 vials at 13.2 per day for 16.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 226 vials at 14.4 per day for 15.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 86 vials at 3.1 per day for 27.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to buy from Caplin Steriles Limited, whose plant was last inspected NAI on 2024-08-09.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternative manufacturers include Cipla USA Inc. with plants last inspected VAI on 2023-01-27 and 2024-07-25, and Qilu Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd. with a plant last inspected VAI on 2023-05-19.",
